sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Sujet synthétique
  participant A as API Gateway
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant E as Enrollment
  U->>A: DELETE /api/account avec Bearer
  A->>D: marque deleted_at et révoque session
  A->>Q: account.deletion.requested.v1 {userId}
  Q->>E: message minimal
  E->>D: transaction inscription/notification/consentement
  E-->>Q: ack après commit
  Note over D: commandes conservées selon durée simulée
